title:
Fill the area between two horizontal curves.

# Example: Sine vs Cosine
```JavaScript
var N = 100,
    x = C3.Array.patternOfInt(N, n => n),
    y1 = C3.Array.patternOfDbl(N, n => Math.sin(n * (Math.PI * 2 / (N - 1)))),
    y2 = C3.Array.patternOfDbl(N, n => 1 + Math.cos(n * (Math.PI * 2 / (N - 1))));
PlotAxes.make().fillBetween({
  x: x,
  y1: y1,
  y2: y2
}).show();
```

@see PlotAxes
@see https://matplotlib.org/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.axes.Axes.fill_between.html
